    <description>BOPI-605
Products in this calculation:
Third Party Invoicing (Usage) - FWSI1200. BOPI-603 updated to set ARR to 0 for cancelled lines. BOPI-620 updated to set the ARR for cancelled lines to the original amount as a negative value
5/4/2026 SALDEV-1203 Add in new decision criteria to only calculate ARR if Quote Line Type = New.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation.Opp_Product_ARR__c} * (-1)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>((Int&apos;l Sponsor % * Total $ Flows) * 2%)+($35 * (1-(Int&apos;l Sponsor %) * (Yearly Invoiced Sent))</description>
        <name>TPI_ARR_Calculation</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>(
    (({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.International_Sponsor__c} / 100) * {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Total_Flows__c} * 0.02)
    +
    (35 * (1 - {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.International_Sponsor__c} / 100) * {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Yearly_Invoiced_Sent__c})
)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>(Opp Product) TPI ARR Calculator {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>(Opp Product) TPI ARR Calculator</label>
